1. Local Ancestry for CHR7

Hiding Cromshell Random Python Warning:
1. echo 'export PYTHONWARNINGS="ignore::FutureWarning"' >> ~/.bashrc
2. source ~/.bashrc

Curl to find out if something failed
1. curl -s http://localhost:8000/api/workflows/v1/{workflow}/status

2. curl -s http://localhost:8000/api/workflows/v1/7db76563-cab0-451d-beae-30981c72b015/metadata | \
jq '.calls["SAIGE_GENE.get_covariates2"][] | {executionStatus, backendStatus, failures}'

# Delete CROMSHELL BUCKET
1. find /home/jupyter/.cromwell -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 -exec rm -rf {} +
2. du -sh /home/jupyter/.cromwell